# Documentation

- Keep docs **English**; Arabic only for quoted UI/product labels.
- Mark **Confirmed** vs **Proposal** vs **Open** — move resolved opens to [decisions.md](../../docs/decisions.md).
- Cross-link related pages; update [README.md](../../README.md) index when adding files.
- Do not state that Flutter app code, tests, or CI exist unless they do in the repo.
- Mermaid diagrams must match [data-schema.md](../../docs/data-schema.md) entities.
